ZB-CT01 Firmware
Alternative CCT firmware for the eWeLight / Tuya ZB-CT01 (module ZYZB010, Telink TLSR8258).

This product is a fork of:
  doctor64/tuyaZigbee — https://github.com/doctor64/tuyaZigbee

and is built on:
  Telink tl_zigbee_sdk
